像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-18-2026/</guid></item><item><title>退市潮过后，伦敦股市能否扭转颓势？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/after-a-wave-of-delistings-can-londons-stock-market-reverse-the-decline/</link><description>伦敦证交所的上市公司数量比 10 年前减少了 900 家，但其首席执行官朱莉娅·霍格特 (Julia Hoggett) 表示，关于末日的说法是错误的。她分享了让伦敦重新焕发活力的计划。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/JuliaHoggett_2280x1920.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 10:40:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/after-a-wave-of-delistings-can-londons-stock-market-reverse-the-decline/</guid></item><item><title>三名利用 Anthropic 的 Claude 黑客入侵 OpenAI 并获取其源代码并获得 6,500 美元奖励的人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/open-ai-hacked-anthropic-claude-source-code-6500-reward/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2287521404-e1789173294554.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 10:04:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/open-ai-hacked-anthropic-claude-source-code-6500-reward/</guid></item><item><title>秘密的事实是美国企业在人工智能方面进展太慢。有些是谨慎，有些是糟糕的招聘</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/secret-truth-corporate-america-moving-too-slow-on-ai/</link><description>上周，人类学研究员雅各布·考克森 (Jacob Coxon) 公开辞职，让人工智能放慢速度的理由变得更加激烈，但人工智能的采用速度已经太慢了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Orange-Black-Minimal-Vacation-Traveler-Youtube-Thumbnail-680--490-px-5.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/secret-truth-corporate-america-moving-too-slow-on-ai/</guid></item></channel></rss>